== Section 1 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section1>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<blockquote><Carved roughly></blockquote>
<blockquote>I used to pick up Mantas when I was little. You could clean their gills, and pet them, and they didn't seem to mind. My older sister was horrified when I told her what I'd been doing. But once, a Manta bit off a piece of my finger, and I knew things would never be the same. If I sight a cloud of them now, I know to steer the other way.</blockquote>
<blockquote>It makes me sad that they are angry at us. I suppose the Mantas are only defending themselves. All of us are desperate, knowing everything could be a threat, or if not, prey. At least if we find friendship, it can help us feel part of something.</blockquote>
</div>
